            <div xml:id="d311-a78">

                <pb facs="0715" n="631" sameAs="frus:frus1886/pg631"/>

                <p rendition="#center">[Seal: State of Chihuahua, court of justice of the peace,
                    District of Guerrero.]</p>
                <p>Interrogatory prescribed by this court for the examination of the persons
                    cognizant of the occurrences which happened at Teopar on January 11, last.</p>
                <list>
                    <label>1.</label>
                    <item>State your name, age, residence, business, &amp;c.</item>
                    <label>2.</label>
                    <item>Do you know what class of Indians were those who fought against the column
                        which went out from here, Temosachic, during the encounter that took place
                        at Teopar on said day?</item>
                    <label>3.</label>
                    <item>If you know the cause of the combat, state it and give all the
                        details.</item>
                    <label>4.</label>
                    <item>Do you know to what reservation those Indians belonged?</item>
                    <label>5.</label>
                    <item>Were they accompanied by civilized persons?</item>
                    <label>6.</label>
                    <item>Do you know the name of the American officer who led them, and to what
                        corps or force he belonged?</item>
                    <label>7.</label>
                    <item>If you know that those Indians committed any depredations upon national
                        territory, state so, giving all the details.</item>
                    <label>8.</label>
                    <item>State, if you know, whether the Americans or Indians wore a dress or any
                        insignia that could make them known as being in military service.</item>
                    <label>9.</label>
                    <item>Give the source of your knowledge of what you have stated.</item>
                </list>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left"><placeName>Canton Guerrero</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1886-02-13">February 13,
                        1886</date>.</dateline>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>MANUEL RUBIO.</signed></closer>
            </div>
